    {
      "id": "tnCjazVz7dfeToP24uwQF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2042.5250909821455,
      "y": 3222.8523974710383,
      "width": 467.24755859375,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 268626731,
      "version": 503,
      "versionNonce": 1297037099,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789487207338,
      "created": 1789486161138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- Handle 100k requests/second\n- rate limit on x requests/second\n\nWhat is the type of requests to limit?\n- API Key based, User ID, IP Address or endpoint path\n- Taking API Key based\n\nRate limiting multiple window like 100req/s and 1000 req/min\n\n- fail closed\n- Should not go beyond and fail with 429 rate limit error\n\nCentralized/dynamic rule management",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- Handle 100k requests/second\n- rate limit on x requests/second\n\nWhat is the type of requests to limit?\n- API Key based, User ID, IP Address or endpoint path\n- Taking API Key based\n\nRate limiting multiple window like 100req/s and 1000 req/min\n\n- fail closed\n- Should not go beyond and fail with 429 rate limit error\n\nCentralized/dynamic rule management",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "L2gEzJfoUgFTV8fxoRd3K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2040.7510249384352,
      "y": 3519.949089927491,
      "width": 600.19140625,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 978760261,
      "version": 378,
      "versionNonce": 1264310059,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789487311875,
      "created": 1789486322405,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non functional requirements\n- Sub-millisecond latency on edge location and little higher for across regions\n- latency p99 < 200 ms\n- Availability: high availability for rate limiter service itself",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non functional requirements\n- Sub-millisecond latency on edge location and little higher for across regions\n- latency p99 < 200 ms\n- Availability: high availability for rate limiter service itself",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pHOs0zav1TeKJ4Qwt6JLS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1641.1278231105707,
      "y": 3382.5374398291683,
      "width": 341.1356506347656,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1135057541,
      "version": 264,
      "versionNonce": 84902565,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789487954252,
      "created": 1789487330191,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Failure Mode Policy Challenge\n\nWhat if the complete service is down?\nfail-close model where we don't allow traffic\nto go down and fail with 429",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Failure Mode Policy Challenge\n\nWhat if the complete service is down?\nfail-close model where we don't allow traffic\nto go down and fail with 429",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6Zb3AF0jKyzU6gsE5Hw4M",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2035.876764714897,
      "y": 3636.779382180995,
      "width": 886.399169921875,
      "height": 440,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 795456011,
      "version": 689,
      "versionNonce": 1441550373,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789488649951,
      "created": 1789488004604,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sizing and Estimation\n\nQPS: 100k/s\nActive keys: 10M\nGeographic location: 5\n\nMemory:\n~2.5GB given 10M keys with 250 bytes (32bytes key + timestamp 16 bytes + 8 bytes counter + cache overhead)\nAdding a safety factor multiplier of 2 then 5GB\n\nNetwork:\n100k/s RPS\n1 request sized about 1KB\nWith check or update it can reach to 100MBps = 800Mbps\n\nA normal cache instance can reach upto 80k to 100k req. So to adjust the bandwidth we may require\n\n\nSo instances needed 800/80\n\nCompute/Storage Cluster\n3 Cache instances per cluster that would be storing 1.5GB data across",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sizing and Estimation\n\nQPS: 100k/s\nActive keys: 10M\nGeographic location: 5\n\nMemory:\n~2.5GB given 10M keys with 250 bytes (32bytes key + timestamp 16 bytes + 8 bytes counter + cache overhead)\nAdding a safety factor multiplier of 2 then 5GB\n\nNetwork:\n100k/s RPS\n1 request sized about 1KB\nWith check or update it can reach to 100MBps = 800Mbps\n\nA normal cache instance can reach upto 80k to 100k req. So to adjust the bandwidth we may require\n\n\nSo instances needed 800/80\n\nCompute/Storage Cluster\n3 Cache instances per cluster that would be storing 1.5GB data across",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
