      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cold Start / Idle Keys:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Cold Start / Idle Keys:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "HIriRlGs9iFlct3-4evym",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4255.872975719383,
      "y": 4259.229650265814,
      "width": 785.2635498046875,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 448591557,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1693069227,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789496562080,
      "created": 1789496561134,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If a brand-new API key starts making requests, how does a region know how many tokens to give it\nwithout contacting the control plane?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If a brand-new API key starts making requests, how does a region know how many tokens to give it without contacting the control plane?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4ue8VyrPiR6h3XkjJPgOs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4290.9850973014145,
      "y": 4339.229650265814,
      "width": 715.039306640625,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 885425163,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1506948229,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789496562080,
      "created": 1789496561135,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solution: Pre-allocate a default low \"starter quota\" locally (e.g., 5% of global capacity) and\nimmediately ping the central store for full quota resolution in the background.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solution: Pre-allocate a default low \"starter quota\" locally (e.g., 5% of global capacity) and immediately ping the central store for full quota resolution in the background.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2QKylurruq-uiF319t9Gr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4562.848821056297,
      "y": 4429.229650265814,
      "width": 171.31185913085938,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1138480677,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 184353355,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789496562080,
      "created": 1789496561135,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Control Plane Outage:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Control Plane Outage:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "OhI4FBKtfVKt_M3hlMVXI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4263.729054820946,
      "y": 4479.229650265814,
      "width": 769.5513916015625,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1494207147,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1896045541,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789496562081,
      "created": 1789496561135,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If the Central Control Plane drops, regional clusters freeze their last-known token allocations and\ncontinue operating locally. The system gracefully degrades without total outage.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If the Central Control Plane drops, regional clusters freeze their last-known token allocations and continue operating locally. The system gracefully degrades without total outage.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zdhxWDpA38S5KnySvZvtv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5302.487238225664,
      "y": 3349.092441571215,
      "width": 687.1673583984375,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 851122379,
      "version": 303,
      "versionNonce": 360110085,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789574750348,
      "created": 1789574668500,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Failures on different components:\n\n1. Redis failure\nTo ensure high availability:\n1. cluster sharding: redis keys are shared across multiple nodes using consistent hashing\non hash(api_key) to distribute 100k QOPS load evenly\n2. Each master shard will have ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Failures on different components:\n\n1. Redis failure\nTo ensure high availability:\n1. cluster sharding: redis keys are shared across multiple nodes using consistent hashing\non hash(api_key) to distribute 100k QOPS load evenly\n2. Each master shard will have ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
